    {
        "content": "<p>kestred opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15330\">PR #15330</a> from <code>kestred:cranelift-gvn-depth</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Fixes #15263.</p>\n<p><code>depth_of_block_in_gvn_map</code> finds a block by scanning <code>gvn_map_blocks</code>, which is quadratic when the dominator tree is<br>\ndeep. This records each block's index when it is pushed and looks it up, with a debug assertion that the two agree.</p>\n<p>For my ordinary test corpus (~20 programs of various shapes) compile time is unchanged.</p>\n<p>For a pathological program (a chain of 16,384 blocks) at <code>opt_level=speed</code>, the egraph pass goes from 1.28 s to 0.23 s.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 641325378,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1794939025
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>kestred requested <a href=\"https://github.com/cfallin\">cfallin</a> for a review on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15330\">PR #15330</a>.</p>",
        "id": 641325379,
